nfo about E having Umber links unless derived from Amber links via Rule 15. Since there's no Amber link from E, Rule 15 doesn't apply here.\n\nTherefore, we don't have any information that E has a link Umber 13 to C. So the antecedent of Rule 14 (E has Umber 13 to C) is not established. If the antecedent isn't true, then the rule doesn't apply. Therefore, Rule 14 doesn't tell us anything about Pearl 12 in this case.\n\nSo, there's no rule that directly connects to E having or not having Pearl 12 except Rule 14, which we can't apply because we don't know if E has the Umber link to C. Also, none of the other records mention Pearl 12. So the status of Pearl 12 for E isn't determined by the given information. Therefore, the answer should be undetermined (B).\n</think>\n\n{\"answer\": \"B\"}",
